<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 640 300" class="chart chart-timeline" role="img" aria-labelledby="per-second-title per-second-desc"><title id="per-second-title">Damage per second over a 4 s fight, mean of 3 fights</title><desc id="per-second-desc">Step chart of the mean damage dealt in each 1 s of the fight over 3 fights of 4 s. The highest second averages 160.0 damage per second, and the fight overall 108.3.</desc><g class="chart-axes" font-size="11" fill="currentColor"><line x1="80" y1="252" x2="620" y2="252" class="chart-axis-line" stroke="currentColor"></line><line x1="80" y1="28" x2="80" y2="252" class="chart-axis-line" stroke="currentColor"></line><line x1="80" y1="252" x2="80" y2="257" stroke="currentColor"></line><text x="80" y="265" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">0</text><line x1="215" y1="252" x2="215" y2="257" stroke="currentColor"></line><text x="215" y="265" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">1</text><line x1="350" y1="252" x2="350" y2="257" stroke="currentColor"></line><text x="350" y="265" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">2</text><line x1="485" y1="252" x2="485" y2="257" stroke="currentColor"></line><text x="485" y="265" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">3</text><line x1="620" y1="252" x2="620" y2="257" stroke="currentColor"></line><text x="620" y="265" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">4</text><line x1="75" y1="252" x2="80" y2="252" stroke="currentColor"></line><line x1="80" y1="252" x2="620" y2="252" class="chart-grid" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.15"></line><text x="67" y="252" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle">0</text><line x1="75" y1="196" x2="80" y2="196" stroke="currentColor"></line><line x1="80" y1="196" x2="620" y2="196" class="chart-grid" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.15"></line><text x="67" y="196" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle">50</text><line x1="75" y1="140" x2="80" y2="140" stroke="currentColor"></line><line x1="80" y1="140" x2="620" y2="140" class="chart-grid" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.15"></line><text x="67" y="140" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle">100</text><line x1="75" y1="84" x2="80" y2="84" stroke="currentColor"></line><line x1="80" y1="84" x2="620" y2="84" class="chart-grid" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.15"></line><text x="67" y="84" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle">150</text><line x1="75" y1="28" x2="80" y2="28" stroke="currentColor"></line><line x1="80" y1="28" x2="620" y2="28" class="chart-grid" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.15"></line><text x="67" y="28" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle">200</text><text x="350" y="278" class="chart-axis-title" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="hanging">Fight time (s)</text><text x="16" y="140" class="chart-axis-title" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 16 140)">Damage per second</text></g><polyline class="chart-line chart-mean" points="80,72.8 215,72.8 215,143.73 350,143.73 350,196 485,196 485,110.13 620,110.13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></polyline><g class="chart-legend" font-size="11" fill="currentColor"><line x1="80" y1="16" x2="98" y2="16" class="chart-mean" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></line><text x="103" y="16" dominant-baseline="middle">mean damage per second</text></g></svg>
